     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\">cross-posting this awesome job for a data jockey type. <br><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><b>From:</b> Ostermann, Stacey &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">stacey_o...@nps.gov</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Thursday, August 1, 2024 6:24 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">NPSIMDA...@doimspp.onmicrosoft.com</a>; NPS PWR Natural Resource Program Leads &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">PWR_natural_resou...@nps.gov</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> GS-11/12 Data Manager/Data Scientist at MEDN I&amp;M (Thousand Oaks or San Diego)</span>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nHi everyone,</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nThe Mediterranean Coast Network Inventory and Monitoring Program is currently recruiting a\r\n<a href=\"https://www.usajobs.gov/job/802394200\" title=\"https://www.usajobs.gov/job/802394200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.usajobs.gov/job/802394200&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492788371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1EWDPZ9FuNRVasJICRehOX\">\r\nGS-11/12 Data Manager/Data Scientist</a>.  Applications will be accepted until August 13<sup>th</sup> or 101 applications are received, whichever comes first. </div>\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;max-width:800px;min-width:424px\">\r\n<table style=\"border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(200,200,200);border-radius:2px;width:100%\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:12px;min-height:126px;overflow:hidden;width:240px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://www.usajobs.gov/job/802394200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.usajobs.gov/job/802394200&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492788371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1EWDPZ9FuNRVasJICRehOX\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"126\" style=\"width:240px;min-height:126px;display:block\" src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/QVoVugbcwdt8zM1_g_Hj4DhHO8yXXDPkHtZaZ4fmoRWNB6MAL4M658GCBUz9nU--acqHf1sGwW1mWthuJHXRBCaCr95RGWO_MVF9KzaDKJKv-g=s0-d-e1-ft#https://www.bing.com/th?id=OVF.XRU9O8Es%2fz0tyfAKLIJAqg&amp;pid=Api\"></a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:300;margin-right:8px;font-family:wf_segoe-ui_light,&quot;Segoe UI Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://www.usajobs.gov/job/802394200\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.usajobs.gov/job/802394200&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492788371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1EWDPZ9FuNRVasJICRehOX\">Biologist (Data Scientist) / Ecologist (Data Scientist)</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(166,166,166);font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif\">\r\n<a href=\"http://www.usajobs.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.usajobs.gov&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492788371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39AolEzbrqjyp9iNh7d2au\">www.usajobs.gov</a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nThe position will be duty stationed in Thousand Oaks or San Diego, California. The incumbent will work with an amazing team of long-term monitoring program leads at Cabrillo National Monument, Channel Islands National Park, and Santa Monica Mountains National\r\n Recreation Area. </div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nWe&#39;re very excited to find our next Data Manager! Please share this announcement widely.  Prospective applicants are welcome to contact me for additional information. </div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nBest,</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nStacey</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<b><br>\r\n</b></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin:0px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(32,31,30)\">\r\nStacey Ostermann-Kelm, Ph.D.<br>\r\nProgram Manager, Mediterranean Coast Network</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin:0px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(32,31,30)\">\r\nNational Park Service Inventory and Monitoring Program</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin:0px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(32,31,30)\">\r\n1 Baxter Way, Suite 180</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin:0px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(32,31,30)\">\r\nWestlake Village, CA 91361<br>\r\nCell <a href=\"tel:(805)%20338-3955\" value=\"+18053383955\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">805-338-3955</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin:0px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(32,31,30)\">\r\n<a href=\"https://www.nps.gov/im/medn/index.htm\" title=\"https://www.nps.gov/im/medn/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.nps.gov/im/medn/index.htm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492788371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Bm25S8es48DqkjjC_t6VF\">Mediterranean Coast Inventory and Monitoring Network</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-